      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-[1.7] text-text-muted mb-12">
        I'm always open to discussing new projects, creative ideas, or opportunities to be part of your vision. 
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 mb-12">
        <a href="mailto:tanisha.c.badgujar@gmail.com" class="magnetic-btn group relative inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-4 bg-surface-hi text-text font-medium rounded-xl border border-glass-border overflow-hidden hover:text-white transition-colors">
          <span class="relative z-10 flex items-center gap-2">
